   "output_schema": {}
  },
  {
   "goal": "Look for structural patterns in colors, locations, domino orientations, possible exact intended output, and whether one demo would be valuable.",
   "context": "Test grid details: top row all 2. Remaining: color3 dominoes at (1,2)(1,3), (5,4)(5,5), (8,0)(9,0); color6 at (1,7)(2,7),(4,8)(4,9); color7 at (2,5)(3,5); color8 at (3,1)(3,2); color9 at (6,2)(7,2); color4 at (6,8)(7,8); color1 at (8,5)(8,6); color5 at (9,7)(9,8). Think about rules. Suggest action.",
   "role": "leaf",
